---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Btn from "../components/Btn.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Download Sténtor"
  description="Download Sténtor. Free to try, no account required."
>
  <section class="max-w-[1040px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-24 md:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-[760px] mb-12">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.08em] uppercase text-red-500 mb-4">Download</p>
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-[72px] tracking-[-0.06em] leading-[0.98] font-semibold mb-5">Download Sténtor.</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-text-2 leading-[1.55] max-w-[720px]">
        Free to try. No account required. Use Sténtor to prepare, cue and share surtitles, translations and audio descriptions for live performance.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-10">
      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-hairline bg-surface p-5 md:p-6">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs text-text-3 mb-3">macOS</p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] mb-2">Apple Silicon</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-3 leading-[1.55] mb-5">The first public desktop build will appear here.</p>
        <Btn href="/contact" variant="ghost">Ask for current build</Btn>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-hairline bg-surface p-5 md:p-6">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs text-text-3 mb-3">Windows</p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] mb-2">Windows</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-3 leading-[1.55] mb-5">Windows builds are planned after the macOS release.</p>
        <Btn href="/contact" variant="ghost">Stay informed</Btn>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-hairline bg-surface p-5 md:p-6">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs text-text-3 mb-3">Linux</p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] mb-2">Linux</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-3 leading-[1.55] mb-5">Linux builds are planned after the desktop release stabilises.</p>
        <Btn href="/contact" variant="ghost">Stay informed</Btn>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] gap-4">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-hairline bg-sunken p-5 md:p-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] mb-2">Using Sténtor in rehearsal or performance?</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-3 leading-[1.6] mb-5">
          We would love to hear how it worked for you. Field notes, operator comments and audience responses help improve the tool, but they are not required to download or try Sténtor.
        </p>
        <Btn href="/contact" variant="primary">Share field notes</Btn>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-hairline bg-sunken p-5 md:p-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] mb-2">Need the workflow?</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-3 leading-[1.6] mb-5">
          Read how Sténtor moves from script preparation to live cueing, screens and audience phones.
        </p>
        <Btn href="/docs" variant="ghost">Read the workflow</Btn>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
